                    "level": {
                      "value": 4
                    },
                    "description": {
                      "value": "You can pronounce and repeat words with near-perfect accuracy even if you don't understand their meaning, and you can write them down in a phonetic script that allows you or another creature with Phonetic Training to read it later. Even if the words are in a language with sound you can't pronounce, you can faithfully transcribe them.\n\nMemorizing long sequences of words remains just as difficult as it is normally."
